@startuml
[*] --> QUEUED
QUEUED --> AWAITING_APPROVAL
AWAITING_APPROVAL --> PREPARING : exact human grant
AWAITING_APPROVAL --> CANCELLED : no process started
PREPARING --> RUNNING : native boundary verified
PREPARING --> FAILED : startup or policy failure
PREPARING --> INTERRUPTED : owner absent after restart
RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED : valid transport result
RUNNING --> FAILED : runtime, parse, policy or validator failure
RUNNING --> TIMED_OUT : process tree stopped
RUNNING --> CANCELLED : termination confirmed
RUNNING --> INTERRUPTED : owner and child no longer match
@enduml
